Included in this repository
---------------------------
IBM Plex Sans Arabic (web/fonts/)
    Copyright 2019 IBM Corp. All rights reserved. SIL Open Font License 1.1, see web/fonts/OFL.txt.
    The page serves these font files from the box itself.

IBM Plex Sans Arabic, as outlines (docs/img/wordmark-en.svg, docs/img/wordmark-ar.svg, docs/img/social-preview.png)
    The letter shapes of the two wordmarks are outlines of IBM Plex Sans Arabic SemiBold, and the text of the social
    preview card is set in IBM Plex Sans Arabic. Copyright 2019 IBM Corp. SIL Open Font License 1.1, see
