Block lists and the app catalogue (lists/)
    Everything in lists/ (the *.txt block lists and services.json, the catalogue of apps) is dedicated to the public
    domain under CC0 1.0, see lists/LICENSE.

The host model (model/host-model.json)
    A small model, trained by tools/suggest-hosts.py from the block lists in lists/ and from the Cisco Umbrella
    Popularity List (the million most looked-up domain names, https://s3-us-west-1.amazonaws.com/umbrella-static/index.html),
    which served as examples of ordinary names. The file holds pieces of the apps' own names and numbers, not that list.
    GPL-3.0-or-later, like the code. Cisco and Cisco Umbrella are trademarks of Cisco Systems, Inc.; Sinko is not
    affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Cisco.

Not covered by the GPL: the Sinko name and marks
    The name "Sinko", the Arabic spelling سينكو as a product mark, and the Sinko logo and wordmarks are the project's
    marks, not GPL-licensed software: web/icon.svg, web/icon-192.png, web/icon-512.png, web/icon-maskable-512.png,
    web/apple-touch-icon.png, and everything in docs/img/ (logo.svg, wordmark-en.svg, wordmark-ar.svg,
    social-preview.png and the screenshots). Some of them ship inside the release archive because the parent page
