Services Sinko can contact
--------------------------
GitHub (github.com, api.github.com, raw.githubusercontent.com): releases, update checks and block lists.
Cloudflare (Workers, D1): the optional anonymous "boxes online" counter, only after the parent says yes
(docs/privacy.md). Cloudflare for Families (1.1.1.3 and 1.0.0.3) is the upstream DNS service that a new Pi-hole installed
by Sinko's installer is set to use; it is Pi-hole's choice of resolver, not Sinko's, and the box's lookups that Pi-hole
cannot answer itself go to it (docs/privacy.md, "The sites your family looks up").
